Example 5: Sets A and B are shown below. Find A ∩ B and A ∪ B.
A = {1, 2, 3, 4}    B = {2, 4, 6, 8}
Solution:
A ∩ B = {2, 4}
A ∪ B = {1, 2, 3, 4, 6, 8}
If there are no elements in the intersection of two sets, we say the intersection is an empty set: ∅.

Example 6: Use a Venn Diagram to illustrate the sets. Find A ∩ B.
a. A = {1, 2, 3}
B = ℕ
b. A = {2, 4, 6}
B = {1, 3, 5}
Solution:
a. A ∩ ℕ = {1, 2, 3}
b. A ∩ B = ∅

